WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:05.980
Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:12.440
Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:16.400
The Age of Detectives.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.620
The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:24.460
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:08.810
I can finally defeat you today!

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.450
Where did you take Henriette-san?!

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:29.580
That day, you lost your Toys, and you became completely useless...

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:42.260
How admirably you've revived, Sherlock Shellingford!

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:53.510
<i>She's reading my movements. In that case...!</i>

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:54.940
Turn into a doll!

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:56.980
Say that to yourself!

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:58.320
Damn!

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:11.750
It's dangerous, you know. Good boy, good boy.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:15.210
I understand that you don't want to be separated from my beautiful self, but let go!

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:17.820
Will do.

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:21.300
Bye bye~

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:27.930
Toys of Disguise, so devilish!!

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:32.180
Beautiful You, I choose you! Come out!!

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:42.560
Beautiful You saved beautiful me!

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:44.950
I love you, Twenty!

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:47.760
Violence is wrong!!

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:53.060
Um... I-I'm sorry...

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.170
Phantom Thief Arsène! At last!

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.090
What will you do now?

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:18.550
Now that's the Sherlock Shellingford I know! Entertain me more!

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.070
Sher isn't alone!

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:25.360
Herc-san...

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.620
Um... I...

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:29.440
She's not down yet!

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.370
Cordelia-san...

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:33.790
She's on top of the rope!

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:38.750
You've finally gathered together.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.710
Arsène! Give back Henriette-san!

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:45.220
This feels too good.

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:50.220
Look. Those are detectives.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.190
Milky Holmes has...

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.370
...come back!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.400
Welcome back.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:02.360
I won't hold back anymore. I shall fight you with my all!

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.990
Watch out! It's her Toys of Resplendence!

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:11.660
Wrath of Zeus.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:17.830
What? Resplendence was only this―

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:20.870
Nero!

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:22.750
N-Not Resplendence...

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:25.380
No way... Arsène's Toys has...

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:26.840
...powered up...

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:33.220
I can feel the same high that Sherlock is on!

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:37.010
This ever-increasing power that makes my heart seethe with joy!

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:41.490
This exhilarating power that even Resplendence pales in comparison to!

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:45.150
My power is overflowing all around me!

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:52.010
What's wrong...

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:55.120
Is this all the power you've got after getting your Toys back?

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:58.760
No, right?

00:05:58.760 --> 00:06:00.580
Come at me like you mean it!

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:16.180
Too many people...

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:21.560
Arsène...

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:30.410
Arsène!

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.510
<i>To lift up something of that size...</i>

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:37.700
<i>That's a level that I can aim for as a phantom thief!</i>

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:39.750
<i>All because you're here...</i>

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:42.500
<i>Strong ones have strong foes!</i>

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.250
You won't get away!

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:46.980
Arsène-sama!!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:49.490
Whoa...

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:50.640
Her Toys has...

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:52.050
...powered up now.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.320
I'm surprised.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:00.940
We will arrest you!

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:04.010
Try it if you can.

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:07.780
Chase me down to the ends of the earth until you catch me!

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:10.110
You don't have to tell us that!

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:24.030
That's how it's done, Milky Holmes!

00:07:25.430 --> 00:07:27.380
But it's still not enough.

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.970
Now, satisfy me!

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:46.540
Here should be fine.

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:47.230
Yes.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:50.850
Sorry, everyone...

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:53.800
Herc, you're amazing!

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:55.030
Embarrassing...

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:58.290
You hold a wonderful Toys, Herc.

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:03.620
I can't fight with my Toys alone.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:07.450
If we combine our powers, we can do anything.

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:08.840
Right?

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:10.460
Cordelia-san...

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:16.390
You're going to fight and win using your Toys so there's no reason to get embarrassed over it! You're a detective, so it's fine! Use it as much as you can, go go go go go!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.020
Nero!

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:22.890
There's no end to them!

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:24.150
Let's gather together?

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:25.060
Okay!

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:27.310
There's too many...

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:30.280
Herc! Cordelia!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:31.290
Thanks for waiting!

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:31.850
Sher!

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:32.280
Nero!

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:34.690
If we're together...

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:36.780
The rescue of our student council president...

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.630
The arrest of Arsène...

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:40.180
We can do them both!

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.110
Herc, Nero! Draw their attention for a bit!

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:46.760
Okay!

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:47.890
We'll try...

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:03.450
All four of them have combined their feelings...

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:06.940
Their Toys' output has increased from normal! Excellent!

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.270
Sher! Wave beam, seventy-five degrees at one o'clock!

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:11.150
Roger!

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:20.870
<i>Worthy opponents...</i>

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:24.070
<i>Mutual adoration that spawned our rivalry...</i>

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:28.250
<i>The only ones who can make me feel this way are those girls!</i>

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:30.460
Fire.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:40.850
Sher!

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:42.620
Let's go!

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:43.720
Yeah!

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:44.980
Herc-san!

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.230
Let's go.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:47.160
Nero!

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:48.940
Gotcha!

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.000
Herc! You'll have three seconds!

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.970
Sher! We'll leave the rest to you!

00:09:57.970 --> 00:09:58.740
Yeah!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.110
Launch!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.080
One!

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.030
Two!

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:04.870
Hiyah!

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:06.690
Sher!

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.460
We're counting on you!

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:11.130
Arsène!!

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:16.090
<i>Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.</i>

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:20.920
<i>Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.</i>

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:23.240
<i>The Age of Detectives.</i>

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:25.750
<i>The two flowers, vying for beauty.</i>

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:29.770
<i>Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.</i>

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.670
Too bright...!

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:57.670
Henriette-san?!

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.590
You're Henriette-san!

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:06.270
This softness, this size... No mistaking it!

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:09.430
So you were safe! Thank goodness!

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.730
Everyone, this is Henriette-san!

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.260
What are you saying, Sher?

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:15.680
No way that's true!

00:11:15.680 --> 00:11:16.430
No way!

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:19.490
She definitely is! Touch them for yourself!

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:21.500
If you insist...

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:22.810
Let's see here...

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:24.360
Excuse us!

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:27.830
This feeling is...!

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:30.910
I remember savoring this before...!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.670
Henriette-san!

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.960
I-I'm not Henriette―

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:41.050
Yes you are!

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:52.390
You really are Henriette-san! We were totally right!

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:53.930
Why is the student council president...

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:55.770
...acting as Arsène?

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:57.700
I-I'm not Henriette!

00:11:57.700 --> 00:11:59.850
You can't fool us.

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:02.590
That's right! I want you to give us an explanation!

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:04.240
I don't resemble her at all!

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:05.370
You can't fool us!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.460
Who is this Henriette you speak of?

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:08.300
That again?

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.920
Henriette-san!

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:12.580
Meteor.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:35.900
Ah, a shooting star!

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:40.690
What did you wish for, Kokoro?

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:43.040
To turn back into a human, quickly!

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:46.850
Yes. For world peace, you say?

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:48.070
No!!

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:53.370
Henriette-san! Cordelia-san! Nero, Herc-san!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:57.180
A lot has happened, but I couldn't care less.

00:12:57.180 --> 00:13:01.150
True that. Who cares if the prez is Arsène.

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:02.860
Forgive and forget.

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:05.390
I am not Henriette.

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:06.760
Quit that.

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:13.640
Sherlock, where do you want to land?

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:16.180
I...

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:54.510
Ow...

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:56.120
Painful!

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:59.490
We're gonna suffocate...

00:13:59.490 --> 00:14:01.850
I thought we'd be goners...

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:03.940
Ah, where's Arsène?

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:07.820
Arsène!

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:09.390
You...!

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:11.280
Give back Henriette-san!

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:15.820
Don't act like you don't know! Give her back to us!

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:19.280
Why are we here, again?

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:20.590
Now that you mention it...

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:25.380
We were trying to defeat Arsène on top of that rock by pooling our powers, and... Huh?

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:31.520
<i>The shock of the impact must've made them forget that I'm Henriette...</i>

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:34.850
Milky Holmes.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:40.310
You have won for today. I will give back Henriette-san. However...

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.350
I shall not lose next time.

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:47.620
H-Hey, wait a minute! Arsène!

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:50.820
Hold up! We're gonna arrest you! Hey!!

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:54.200
Kamaboko!

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:03.750
Milky Holmes ~oink!

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:11.700
It seems that we've won against Arsène! I don't remember how, though...

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:14.350
Looks like it! Though I don't remember!

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:18.890
If all four of us combine our powers, then this is nothing to us! Though I don't remember!

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:21.520
Yes. I don't remember, though.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:28.230
Milky Holmes!!

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:31.200
Arsène-sama, it is reassuring to see you safe and sound.

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:35.990
Ah, thank goodness! Really, thank goodness! I'm so happy that I can't stay clothed!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:40.100
Milky Holmes' Toys have returned to them, though...

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:42.650
We can have battles again. Isn't that fine?

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:48.380
That's right. Stealing through difficulty makes the treasure that much more appealing.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.470
The treasure sparkles just like me!

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:59.140
<i>So you've revived, Milky Holmes. Let's continue our fights from now on, shall we?</i>

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.870
"Certificate of Achievement."

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:08.000
"Is hereby presented to Milky Holmes for bringing back the student council president Henriette Mystère,

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:11.910
rescuing G4, letting the phantom thief Arsène get away at the last second―!

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:20.580
―driving her away―driving her away!!―
and for bringing back the peace to Yokohama City!"

00:16:22.650 --> 00:16:23.360
Catch!

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:26.460
Thank you very much!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.960
Milky Holmes ~oink!

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:34.480
It's wrong to give them a certificate of achievement! They let Arsène get away, didn't they?!

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:38.170
Kokoro, when did you get away from Irene?

00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:40.180
Don't talk about her!!

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:43.640
It's fine. There's always another chance.

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:46.810
<i>What the heck...</i>

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:52.110
<i>Giving them a certificate of achievement is unnecessary! My beauty deserves one instead!</i>

00:16:52.930 --> 00:16:57.740
<i>I cannot understand what Arsène-sama is thinking at times.</i>

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:05.410
And now, the moment you've all been waiting for! A chance to see our newly revived, powered-up Toys at work!

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.330
Be afraid!

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:10.330
Here we go, Sher!

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:11.410
Yes!

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.840
3, 2, 1...

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:17.720
Toys!

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:39.910
Huh? That's strange... please let me practice for a bit!

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:41.370
WTF?!?!

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:53.880
You'll blow it away, don't!

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:59.630
<i>Could it be that they've lost not just their memories, but their Toys as well from the shock of the impact?</i>

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:00.690
Useless!

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:03.070
<i>Even though it's finally come back to them....</i>

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:06.810
I-I can't use mine either...

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:09.060
Mine too...

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:11.190
Mine too!

00:18:11.850 --> 00:18:13.190
N-No way!

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:17.310
Our Toys disappeared again!!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:23.620
Serves them right.

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:33.570
W-Well, tomorrow is summer―I mean, winter vacation,

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:39.380
so as students of H-Holmes Detective Academy, please spend it in a shameless manner...

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:40.800
Dismissed.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:42.950
Now then, let's go.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:43.980
Let's.

00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:46.100
Gotta finish up some work...

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:48.560
Kokoro-chan, we can't use our Toys!

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:51.220
Don't call me that!!

00:18:53.000 --> 00:19:00.360
Though they may have protected Yokohama City, Milky Holmes have lost their Toys again and are now back to being useless.

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:11.920
Ahh, so winter vacation starts today, huh...

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:17.480
What will happen to us? Maybe...

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:20.010
Ah, that cloud looks like fish paste!

00:19:32.760 --> 00:19:35.070
We'll be expelled, huh...

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:37.280
Time to make more magazines...

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:42.710
It's so clean!

00:19:43.190 --> 00:19:44.530
Amazing!

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:46.260
I hope you like it.

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:49.060
Henriette-san!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:51.660
The fact that our room's been rebuilt means that...

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:53.450
...we can stay in here?

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:57.330
All in all, though you may have lost your Toys once again,

00:19:57.330 --> 00:20:00.650
it is true that you've protected Yokohama.

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.220
Which means that expulsion...

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:07.310
Yes, the deadline for it is postponed until spring.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.350
You're not gonna cancel it?!

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:17.430
W-Well, it's still fine! Our Toys will come back again for sure!

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:19.650
If we work hard together...

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:22.860
Milky Holmes will forever be indestructible!

00:20:24.150 --> 00:20:27.990
<i>I really hope so. It's kind of tiring for me, you know.</i>

00:20:28.650 --> 00:20:32.790
<i>Your dream is my dream, after all.</i>

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:35.920
Student council president, thank you!!

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:13.640
Excuse me!

00:22:14.990 --> 00:22:16.310
Who are you?

00:22:16.780 --> 00:22:18.270
I feel like...

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:19.770
...I've seen you before...

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:22.870
Ah, so you're the student council president, Henriette!

00:22:22.870 --> 00:22:26.900
I'm transferring to Holmes Detective Academy as of today!

00:22:26.900 --> 00:22:31.150
A transfer student? In the middle of winter vacation? I haven't heard anything.

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:33.010
Here, proof.

00:22:34.900 --> 00:22:37.870
This certainly does have the headmaster's signature...

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:39.510
But...

00:22:39.510 --> 00:22:43.890
Whoa, it's the real Milky Holmes!

00:22:43.890 --> 00:22:45.190
*freak out*

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:47.230
Nice to meet y'all!

00:22:47.230 --> 00:22:48.170
Cordelia-san!

00:22:48.170 --> 00:22:49.590
Hercule-san!

00:22:49.590 --> 00:22:50.890
Nero-san!

00:22:51.440 --> 00:22:52.890
Kamaboko-san!

00:22:54.090 --> 00:22:56.140
Sherlock Shellingford-san!

00:22:58.010 --> 00:23:01.550
Yes, nice to meet you! What shall we call you by?

00:23:01.550 --> 00:23:03.060
Ah, here!

00:23:04.330 --> 00:23:06.230
My name is...

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:08.280
Mori...

00:23:08.770 --> 00:23:09.950
Arty...

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:12.370
Mori Arty!

00:23:12.800 --> 00:23:14.080
